{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/qhohdk","slideIndex":0,"text":"0:00–0:12\n\nWe’re Rick and Max. QAI helps professors see the reasoning behind an answer. In a calculus exercise, several students write forty-two. What went wrong?\n\nSource: Restored ai-classroom-feedback-proposal.md; submission/pitch.md. The 42 example is a synthetic calculus response, not a measured classroom outcome."}
