{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/arlcu8","slideIndex":1,"text":"0:12–0:28\n\nThe professor opens a question from their own material. Students scan a QR code and send a step or a photo. AI compares the work with the approved reference and gives private feedback.\n\nSource: Merged demo/README.md; demo/web/teaching.js. Original prototype screenshot embedded in submission/QAI.pptx, ppt/media/image.jpeg. Screenshot uses synthetic example work."}
