{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/x7lzes","slideIndex":2,"text":"0:28–0:45\n\nThe professor sees the mistakes behind the results. In a six-answer synthetic class, two students omitted the constant eight. An unsupported forty-two triggered a request for the missing step.\n\nSource: submission/classroom-evaluation.md, simulated responses 3, 4 and 6; demo/web/sample-report.js, evidence counts and unclear response. Screenshot captured from isolated local demo, View example report. This is synthetic evidence and does not establish learning gains."}
