{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/ynfqzt","slideIndex":3,"text":"0:45–1:00\n\nThe professor chooses what to explain, then publishes a fresh check. Our next step is one real tutorial: measure whether the report changes teaching, and whether students transfer the idea.\n\nSource: Restored ai-classroom-feedback-proposal.md: professor approval and transfer reassessment; submission/pitch.md: proposed tutorial pilot. These measures are a proposed next test, not demonstrated educational impact."}